  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to WHO Department of Neglected Tropical Diseases for capacity strengthening and Visceral Leismaniasis Program Coordination is a component of World Health Organisation&apos;s Department of Neglected Tropical Diseases for capacity Building reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,200,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
